Id: cmp002w
Severity: WARN
Category: packages
Check: check_compilers
Fix: chown root:root and chmod go-w the compiler.
References: gcc(1)
Controls: CIS 3.3, 4.1; NIST AC-3, CM-5; ISO 8.3, 8.9; CE Secure configuration

A compiler is writable past root: whoever can write it replaces
it, and the next build runs their code. Leave it owned and
writable by root alone.
